The video shows a malicious PDF sent to the target iPhone using AirDrop to initiate the jailbreak, with the file accepted by the user. Calif hasn't shared additional information, and the exact jailbreak steps are unknown. <br/>
<br/>
Earlier this year, <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/27/apple-says-no-one-using-lockdown-mode-has-been-hacked-with-spyware/">Apple told <em>TechCrunch</em></a> that it was not aware of any successful mercenary spyware attacks against an iPhone in Lockdown Mode.<br/>
